{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33595","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 四 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝念淮堧疫疹频，牢笼山海委名臣。\n古来比德由无侣，当代同途岂有人。\n夜宴独吟梁苑月，朝游重见广陵春。\n多年疲瘵全苏息，须到讴谣日满秦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}